        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "Inspired by the Queen of the Night, a flower that reveals its beauty only after dark, this collection explores the quiet significance of a single detail that can bring a whole composition together."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "As the flower completes the plant, the collection draws from the concept of a “missing piece.”"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "text": "The CERE is a collection for those who consider each furniture piece, ritual and emotion they incorporate into their space."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "text": "DISCOVER CERE",
          "href": "https://albero.ph/cere-collection"
        },
        {
          "type": "gallery",
          "slides": [
            {
              "title": null,
